{{!-- spec 012 (R8): shared inline SVG sprite of two STATIC symbols. Every eye
      control references these by id (<use href="#ico-eye"> / "#ico-eye-off");
      the visible state is chosen with a Handlebars conditional at each call
      site — never by rebinding a <use href> at runtime (that errors on the SVG
      resource). Include this partial ONCE per sheet render (near the top of the
      public sheet and the standard sheet); all other sites only <use> the ids.
      16×16, stroke=currentColor so the icon inherits the surrounding color. --}}
